    <typeMember xsi:type="spoon:CtMethod" name="onGasReading">
      <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="One sense-analyse-act cycle for a fresh gas reading: the&#xA;gas-analysis subsystem classifies it and, through its autonomous&#xA;transitions, relays any turn/stop/resume decision to the movement&#xA;subsystem."/>
